 hash algorithm written down in prose can have, and it is the same kind the
 gauntlet produces, obtained without an agent. Making the field mandatory is
-itself a reported result: it broke six writers at once — four fixture builders, a
+itself a reported result: it broke eight writers at once — four fixture builders, a
 command-line tool, the Blender exporter, the pipeline and the C++ exporter — and
 every one was a real gap, each having vendored a specification tree with no
-statement of which revision. The sixth was found late, by a gate that had earlier
+statement of which revision. The last was found late, by a gate that had earlier
